      "summary": "Hourly demand, generation by fuel and interchange for every US balancing authority.",
      "description": "The operational record of the US grid at balancing-authority resolution: hourly demand, hourly generation split by fuel category, and hourly interchange between authorities. The DD4 anchor for the United States, and the dataset against which any modelled US load profile should be sanity-checked.",
